@verbs style styles masteries maestrias
@tier player
@title what you fight with, and how good you are at it

  styles

Lists your unarmed fighting styles, how much of each you have
learnt, and which one you are on.

  style <name>

Switches to the style you name. 'style' and 'styles' are the same
word: the list comes out whenever you name none.

  masteries

Lists your weapon masteries: for every kind of weapon you have come
to handle, how well you handle it.
